    <string name="vadus_sonsk"> नासदासीन्नो सदासीत्तदानीं नासीद्रजो नो व्योमापरो यत्।किमा अवरीवः कुह कस्य शर्मन्नम्भः किमासीद्गहनं गभीरम्॥१॥</string>
    <string name="vadus_english"> Then, neither the non-existent was nor the existent was at that time;There was no air, no sky beyond it.What was covering? Where was it? In whose protection?Was there water, unfathomable, profound?</string>
    <string name="gita_sonsk">  यदा यदा हि धर्मस्य ग्लानिर्भवति भारत।अभ्युत्थानमधर्मस्य तदात्मानं सृजाम्यहम्॥४-७॥</string>
    <string name="gita_english"> Whenever there is a decline in righteousness and an increase in unrighteousness, O Arjuna, at that time I manifest myself on earth.</string>
    <string name="sloka_sonsk">  ॐ पूर्णमदः पूर्णमिदं पूर्णात्पूर्णमुदच्यते।पूर्णस्य पूर्णमादाय पूर्णमेवावशिष्यते॥ </string>
    <string name="sloka_english"> Om. That is complete, this is complete. From the completeness comes the completeness.If completeness is taken away from completeness, only completeness remains.</string>


